it turns out my kids are even smarter than I thought. They knew I might have an accident (we still don’t know exactly what happened), so they backed all my files up beforehand — using this little device called ThePhotoStick OMNI.<br><br>Even better, they showed me how to use it so <span style="font-weight: bold;">I never have to worry about losing my photos OR videos again</span>. Most importantly, it’s really easy to use — <span style="font-weight: bold;">if you’re like me and can’t afford to lose your precious memories, then you really ought to know about this thing!<br></span><br></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-eJwWfJ gOTWZO pf-55_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-jeraig gFfZqp"><div class="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-56_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-57_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ezbkAF deEGdS pf-58_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-60_">What is ThePhotoStick Omni, exactly?<br></span></h2><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-61_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-63_"><br>At first glance, ThePhotoStick Omni&nbsp; looks like a regular <b>U</b><span style="font-weight: bold;">SB drive… but it’s MUCH more than that</span>.<br><br></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/shop-tps-omni-for-computers-and-mobile-devices" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-hiCibw ekDlzN pf-64_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-2137b909--advertorial091.jpg?v=1629320237" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-2137b909--advertorial091.jpg?v=1629320237 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-2137b909--advertorial091_500x.jpg?v=1629320237 320w" width="545" height="545" class="sc-jJoQJp hALhgP"/></a><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-65_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-67_"><br>ThePhotoStick OMNI actually contains <span style="font-weight: bold;">a powerful program that finds, downloads, and safely stores photos and videos on any device — in a single click!<br></span><br>My daughter explained that ThePhotoStick OMNI backs up all my files automatically — I just plug it into my computer and it does the work for me.<br><br>But it’s not just for computers — <span style="font-weight: bold;">it also works on phones and tablets</span>.<br><br></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/shop-tps-omni-for-computers-and-mobile-devices" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-hiCibw ekDlzN pf-68_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-c779e744--advertorial012.jpg?v=1629316416" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-c779e744--advertorial012.jpg?v=1629316416 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-c779e744--advertorial012_500x.jpg?v=1629316416 320w" width="545" height="545" class="sc-jJoQJp hALhgP"/></a><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-69_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-71_"><br>A few years ago, my kids got me an iPhone so the grandkids could FaceTime me and send me photos. <span style="font-weight: bold;">But I never know how to get the photos off my phone!</span> ThePhotoStick OMNI easily plugs into my phone, searches for photos and videos from my family, and downloads them.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">With ThePhotoStick OMNI, I know all my memories are safely stored away, all in one place.<br></span><br></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-eJwWfJ gOTWZO pf-72_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-jeraig gFfZqp"><div class="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-73_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-74_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ezbkAF deEGdS pf-75_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-77_">How does ThePhotoStick Omni work?<br></span></h2><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-78_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-80_"><br>I’ll let you in on a little secret: <span style="font-weight: bold;">I have no idea how ThePhotoStick OMNI ACTUALLY works</span>. (I’m not what you’d call a computer person…)<br><br>All I have to do is plug it in and hit GO.<br><br></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/shop-tps-omni-for-computers-and-mobile-devices" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-hiCibw ekDlzN pf-81_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-c96e8b54--advertorial102.jpg?v=1629316431" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-c96e8b54--advertorial102.jpg?v=1629316431 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-c96e8b54--advertorial102_500x.jpg?v=1629316431 320w" width="545" height="545" class="sc-jJoQJp hALhgP"/></a><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-82_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-84_"><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Then it automatically searches my phone and computer and saves my photo and video files onto the stick.</span><br><br></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/shop-tps-omni-for-computers-and-mobile-devices" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-hiCibw ekDlzN pf-85_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-6e8b541e--advertorial1140kb.jpg?v=1629316434" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-6e8b541e--advertorial1140kb.jpg?v=1629316434 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-6e8b541e--advertorial1140kb_500x.jpg?v=1629316434 320w" width="545" height="545" class="sc-jJoQJp hALhgP"/></a><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-86_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-88_"><br>It works with all my devices, too — <span style="font-weight: bold;">thanks to a 3-headed attachment that makes it completely universal</span>.<br>

